    <origin>GitHub #1098, filed 2026-10-02 by task 156's verifier (owner round 8, "filed as work"). Confirmed and widened by the route authorization sweep (notes/route-authorization-sweep-2026-10-02.md rows 11-16, 37, 38; evidence file idor-group-159.json, 8 findings, all "real" by the skeptic). Owner round 9 (2026-10-03, BINDING): UAC-r2 fixes all 82 sweep findings now, with the round-9 fix pattern. The OData filter injection on the list (sweep noteworthy item, DataverseWebApiService.cs:331) is NOT named in #1098 and is added here. Adversarially reviewed and repaired against the code on 2026-10-02 (see notes).</origin>
