    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="146" status="pending">Sets the owner on every BFF child create and reparent, including CreateEventInDataverseAsync and (by its census) the PUT /{id} re-parent. Not a dependency, but the two must not be in flight on the same files at once. Whichever lands second rebases onto the first and keeps the other's behaviour intact. This task writes no owner logic.</dependency>
      <dependency task="156" status="pending">Re-stamps the children of an intermediate (an event is one) when the intermediate is re-filed. This task stamps the EVENT itself on create and re-parent; it does not re-stamp the event's children. If 156 has landed, the PUT re-parent calls 156's cascade. If not, this task records the PUT re-parent path in notes/task-159-events-authorization.md for 156's inventory, and the main session reconciles at integration.</dependency>
      <dependency task="167" status="pending">Adds Pending waivers for these eight routes. See constraint "waivers".</dependency>
    </dependencies>
