  <justification>
    <existing>Route-id caller-rights filter: `Api/Filters/RecordRouteAccessAuthorizationFilter.cs:79-232` (task 076; attached at `Api/OBOEndpoints.cs`) over `Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/CallerRecordAccessProbe.cs:212-244` and `:386-452`. Per-route declaration filter: `Api/Filters/FinanceAuthorizationFilter.cs` (task 130; finance-named, Record path through the 60-second None cache owned by task 132). Uniform 404: `FinanceAuthorizationFilter.cs:280-290`. Trimmed-list mechanism: `ICallerSystemUserResolver` + `DataverseWebApiService.CreateAuthenticatedRequestAsync(..., impersonateSystemUserId)` (`:199-218`), as word-add-in-r1 task 062 uses for `/api/office/search/entities`. Entity-set resolution: `IGenericEntityService.GetEntitySetNameAsync` (`IGenericEntityService.cs:67`). Regarding builders: `TodoRegardingBuilder.cs:131-280`, `InvoiceReviewService.cs:284-300`, `CoreAncestorResolver.DeriveForHostAsync` (`:452`). Grep for an existing events authorization filter or caller-scoped event query: none.</existing>
    <extension>Yes — no new filter class, service or map. Extend RecordRouteAccessAuthorizationFilter (fixed entity set, route key, denial shape, body declaration) and leave its existing overload unchanged; move UniformRecordNotFound to ProblemDetailsHelper; add one caller-scoped method to IEventDataverseService (the existing app-only method stays for TodoGenerationService, and an optional parameter would let the endpoint reach the app-only query by omission); add two OperationAccessPolicy keys (AppendTo on a regarding target; Write | Append on the re-parented event), because no existing key names these acts without misdescribing them in every deny log ("entity.associate_document" names a document, "finance.*" names finance).</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Any signed-in user lists every sprk_event in the tenant (or breaks out of the owner filter by OData injection), reads any event and its log, creates app-owned events on secure matters, re-parents events into or out of secure matters, and completes, cancels or deletes any event — including deadlines on matters they cannot open. Every request that carries a regarding type writes an integer into a lookup column, and the list and get $select a lookup by its logical name.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

